.wiki-forge/scheduler-approvals.json
# `backup/` holds the ORIGINAL source files (e.g. copyrighted books/EPUBs).
#   Do not publish them. Keep them only on your local disk.
# `raw/`, `output/` are regenerable/ephemeral (rebuild with conv2md / the agent).
backup/
raw/

# The compiled wiki (your knowledge base) IS kept in git by default so the
